# Installed dependencies. A release commit is staged with `git add -A`, so an installed
# node_modules/ went into every tag from v0.155.5 (2,278 files), and `npm install` of such a tag fails (#931).
node_modules/

# The call inventory is GENERATED (`node src/packaging/gh-call-inventory.ts`) and never committed: every pull request that adds a `gh` call rewrote it, so concurrent
# pull requests conflicted on it one after another (a11ign/a11ign#5126). `gh-call-inventory.test.ts` holds the generator against the tree instead.
docs/gh-call-inventory.json
